<http://data.silknow.org/object/1c5308cd-e04f-31a7-bfe9-129e3e4cbce0/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Evening dress of deep cerulean blue wool and silk blend gauze. With a high waist, large puffed short sleeves and low gathered neckline. The full skirt and bodice is mounted on a wide gauze waistband and is lined with cotton. The skirt has a band of yellow chain-stitch embroidery of grapes and vine leaves mid-way down. The sleeves are lined with stiff crinoline. The dress fastens at the back with flat white metal hooks and eyes."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/1c5308cd-e04f-31a7-bfe9-129e3e4cbce0> .

